==Trivia==
*The text when receiving the pet from a cape gamble is: "''Luck be a TzHaar tonight. Jal-Nib-Rek is yours."'' This is a reference to the song "Luck Be a Lady" from the musical ''{{wp|Guys and Dolls}}''.
*TzRek-Zuk had a festive override wearing a [[Santa hat]] during the [[2020 Christmas event/Gallery|2020]], [[2021 Christmas event/Gallery|2021]], [[2022 Christmas event/Gallery|2022]], [[2023 Christmas event/Gallery|2023]], [[2024 Christmas event/Gallery|2024]], and [[2025 Christmas event/Gallery|2025]] Christmas events. Jal-Nib-Rek also had a festive override for the 2023, 2024, and 2025 events.
*Wielding [[Dinh's blazing bulwark]] while having TzRek-Zuk following the player will trigger alternate dialogue.

